| Everything in this repository and package **except** the paid features listed in `LICENSE-COMMERCIAL.md` | Functional Source License 1.1, Apache 2.0 future licence (`FSL-1.1-ALv2`), below |
| The paid features: the files and folders listed in section 1 of [`LICENSE-COMMERCIAL.md`](LICENSE-COMMERCIAL.md), and the parts of `dist/` compiled from them | Soundings Commercial Licence, in [`LICENSE-COMMERCIAL.md`](LICENSE-COMMERCIAL.md) | Soundings Commercial Licence, in [`LICENSE-COMMERCIAL.md`](LICENSE-COMMERCIAL.md) |

In plain terms, and not replacing either licence:

- You can use the scanner free of charge for any purpose except offering a competing product or service. That includes at work, on client projects and in CI.
- Each release also becomes available under the Apache License 2.0 two years after it is published.
- The paid features need a valid licence key for a plan that includes them. You may not remove, disable or get around the licence check.

